    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_123.variants.powers_2_3_5_snug :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ ε > 0, ∀ᶠ n in atTop,\n      ∃ A : Finset ℕ, (A : Set ℕ) ⊆ ↑(powers 2) * ↑(powers 3) * ↑(powers 5) ∧ IsSnug ε A ∧\n        ∑ x ∈ A, x = n",
